    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You repraise your role as the prince that was exiled from his kingdom by a demon worshiping cult. You've joined forces with your companions and the scouts, and now you and your team are on your way to become stronger together, to be able to save your kingdom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your adventures you will enjoy the company of the most intriguing companions and learn what it means to be a leader. And... if you play your cards right maybe even find some romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun fantasy adventure, filled with humor, drama, epic battles, mystery and lots of sex!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/089fde1740886540042a4060c700e7b6.poster.avif?t=1748465988\" width=624 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/089fde1740886540042a4060c700e7b6.webm?t=1748465988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/089fde1740886540042a4060c700e7b6.mp4?t=1748465988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilith Rising - Season 2 is a choice-driven adult Visual Novel featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over thousands of static images and over 25 animated scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 5 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music and SFX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of lewd scenes with various girls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodes 1 - 6 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional content will be added in future updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the kingdom from a demon worshiping cult</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/56557bc82d904dd871e80466b76b37cd.avif?t=1748465988\" width=616 height=220 /></span>A grand plot that somehow revolves around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Date the girl (or girls) of your dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/9e1962ec25a29a4f5c2d1346a72e447a.avif?t=1748465988\" width=616 height=220 /></span>Adventure together with six amazing love interests in an interactive adventure environment where every choice matters in building your relationships - each girl has a unique personality, taste and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your harem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/3efcb8a9eb881decedd8a8a36bcc21cc.avif?t=1748465988\" width=616 height=220 /></span>If you\u2019re up to the ultimate challenge you can try and build a harem with ALL the girls - each with their own personality, likes and dislikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilith Rising - Season 3 and future seasons will continue the story and be released and sold separately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/ceb11fc6bcba47c7a00be49bcd8e6ba3.avif?t=1748465988\" width=616 height=346 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/a9014940b241ae20ee354c0c499eaa17.avif?t=1748465988\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You repraise your role as the prince that was exiled from his kingdom by a demon worshiping cult. You've joined forces with your companions and the scouts, and now you and your team are on your way to become stronger together, to be able to save your kingdom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your adventures you will enjoy the company of the most intriguing companions and learn what it means to be a leader. And... if you play your cards right maybe even find some romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun fantasy adventure, filled with humor, drama, epic battles, mystery and lots of sex!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/089fde1740886540042a4060c700e7b6.poster.avif?t=1748465988\" width=624 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/089fde1740886540042a4060c700e7b6.webm?t=1748465988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/089fde1740886540042a4060c700e7b6.mp4?t=1748465988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilith Rising - Season 2 is a choice-driven adult Visual Novel featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over thousands of static images and over 25 animated scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 5 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music and SFX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of lewd scenes with various girls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodes 1 - 6 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional content will be added in future updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the kingdom from a demon worshiping cult</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/56557bc82d904dd871e80466b76b37cd.avif?t=1748465988\" width=616 height=220 /></span>A grand plot that somehow revolves around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Date the girl (or girls) of your dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/9e1962ec25a29a4f5c2d1346a72e447a.avif?t=1748465988\" width=616 height=220 /></span>Adventure together with six amazing love interests in an interactive adventure environment where every choice matters in building your relationships - each girl has a unique personality, taste and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your harem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/3efcb8a9eb881decedd8a8a36bcc21cc.avif?t=1748465988\" width=616 height=220 /></span>If you\u2019re up to the ultimate challenge you can try and build a harem with ALL the girls - each with their own personality, likes and dislikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilith Rising - Season 3 and future seasons will continue the story and be released and sold separately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/ceb11fc6bcba47c7a00be49bcd8e6ba3.avif?t=1748465988\" width=616 height=346 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864850/extras/a9014940b241ae20ee354c0c4